# iCloud dedup duplicates. ~/Desktop is synced, so an edited project can
# reappear as 'Crease 2.xcodeproj'. xcodebuild then fails with
# "contains N projects" and picks the wrong one.
*[0-9].xcodeproj/
* [0-9].xcodeproj/
*.nosync
